 lf-directed canvassing means you pick the day\, get your turf\, and go. Th
 ere's no launch event to show up to and no meeting spot. We'll get you set
  up beforehand. BEFORE YOUR FIRST SHIFT Your County Captain is Tamika Hami
 lton. She'll reach out after you sign up to get you literature and a turf 
 assignment. We also run a volunteer Slack with a channel for every county 
 in the district. You'll get the invite when you sign up. New to canvass
